<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>@REPO_LABEL@</title>
<style>
  :root { --bg:#fbfbfa; --fg:#1d1d1b; --muted:#66645e; --card:#f1f0ec; --line:#dddbd4; --accent:#2f6f4f; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root { --bg:#151614; --fg:#e8e7e2; --muted:#a19f97; --card:#1f201d; --line:#33342f; --accent:#7cc39b; }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin:0; background:var(--bg); color:var(--fg); font:16px/1.55 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; }
  main { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 48px 16px 64px; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.9rem; margin: 0 0 4px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 40px 0 8px; }
  p, li { color: var(--muted); }
  pre { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; }
  code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }
  p code, td code { background: var(--card); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.88em; color: var(--fg); }
  details { margin-top: 12px; }
  summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--accent); }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.92rem; }
  th, td { text-align: left; padding: 8px 10px 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
  th { font-weight: 600; }
  td { color: var(--muted); }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>@REPO_LABEL@</h1>
  <p>Signed package repositories for Debian, Ubuntu, Linux Mint, Fedora and RHEL-compatible systems. Add it once and updates arrive through your normal system updates.</p>
  <p>Supported: @SUPPORTED@.</p>

  <h2>Quick setup</h2>
  <pre><code>curl -fsSL @BASE_URL@/setup.sh | sudo sh</code></pre>
  <p>Then install a package with <code>sudo apt install &lt;name&gt;</code> or <code>sudo dnf install &lt;name&gt;</code>.</p>

  <h2>Manual setup</h2>
  <details>
    <summary>Debian, Ubuntu, Linux Mint</summary>
<pre><code># Mint and LMDE use their Ubuntu/Debian base release:
suite=$(. /etc/os-release; echo "${UBUNTU_CODENAME:-${DEBIAN_CODENAME:-$VERSION_CODENAME}}")
curl -fsSL @BASE_URL@/key.gpg | sudo tee /usr/share/keyrings/@REPO_ID@-archive-keyring.gpg &gt; /dev/null
sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/@REPO_ID@.sources &gt; /dev/null &lt;&lt;EOF
Types: deb
URIs: @BASE_URL@/deb
Suites: $suite
Components: @COMPONENT@
Signed-By: /usr/share/keyrings/@REPO_ID@-archive-keyring.gpg
EOF
sudo apt update
sudo apt install @REPO_ID@-archive-keyring   # keeps the key and source list up to date</code></pre>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary>Fedora, RHEL, AlmaLinux, Rocky Linux</summary>
<pre><code>sudo dnf install @BASE_URL@/rpm/@REPO_ID@-release.rpm</code></pre>
  </details>

  <h2>Packages</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Package</th><th>Latest</th><th>Releases</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
@PACKAGE_ROWS@
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Removing</h2>
  <p><code>sudo apt purge @REPO_ID@-archive-keyring</code> or <code>sudo dnf remove @REPO_ID@-release</code> removes the repository and key. Signing key: <a href="key.asc">key.asc</a>.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
